                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While the art-genre changing with ingame timeline is a cute idea, the actual gameplay is the same bland D-Pad sword slashing. Combat is clunky and all the mobs feel about the same. Dialog is long winded and often pointless. Feels like this game is a mix of nostalgia and wasting your time. \r\n\r\nHow committed are they to wasting your time? Very. Heck it takes 9 button clicks just to Exit the game back to desktop.",
